.TH ARCH_PRCTL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
arch_prctl \- invokes x86-64 arch_prctl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/arch_prctl.h>
.B int arch_prctl(int operation, unsigned long argument);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes x86-64 arch_prctl with an integer argument. Use
.BR arch_prctl_ptr (3crunch)
for operations requiring a pointer. Changing FS or GS may break the runtime or external libraries.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR arch_prctl (2)
